' === Sequence Diagram: Lupa Password ===
actor Pegawai
participant "Halaman Lupa Password" as ResetPage
participant Sistem
database Database

Pegawai -> ResetPage : Buka form reset password
Pegawai -> ResetPage : Masukkan NIP & No. WA
Pegawai -> ResetPage : Klik tombol kirim permintaan
ResetPage -> Sistem : Validasi data
Sistem -> Database : Simpan permintaan reset
Sistem -> Pegawai : Tampilkan notifikasi permintaan berhasil
@enduml